{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28457","headline":"寄浙东韩八评事 · 杜牧","name":"寄浙东韩八评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一笑五云溪上舟，跳丸日月十经秋。\n鬓衰酒减欲谁泥，迹辱魂慙好自尤。\n梦寐几回迷蛱蝶，文章应解伴牢愁。\n无穷尘土无聊事，不得清言解不休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}